cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SAPI, its data or its code in academic work, please cite the dissertation below."
title: "SAPI — an open-source flood early warning system"
abstract: >-
  Low-cost, open-source flood monitoring and early-warning system: LoRa water-level and
  rain-gauge stations, an ESP32 gateway with NB-IoT failover, a PHP/MySQL web interface
  with multi-channel alerts, MERGE/CPTEC precipitation ingestion, and LightGBM / multiple
  linear regression water-level forecasts 30 to 120 minutes ahead. Developed and validated
  in the field in Florianópolis, Brazil, as a Master's dissertation project at IFSC.
type: software
